  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You can forge an empowering bond among people at peace with one another. As a Magic action, choose a number of willing creatures within 30 feet of you (which can include yourself) equal to your Proficiency Bonus. You create a magical bond among them for 10 minutes or until you use this feature again. While any bonded creature is within 30 feet of another, it can roll a d4 and add the number rolled to an attack roll, an ability check, or a saving throw it makes, no more than once per turn. You can use this feature a number of times equal to your Proficiency Bonus, and you regain all expended uses when you finish a Long Rest.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-d6jfVBHGNVL4NteF\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>The effect adds 1d4 to every attack roll, check, and save: turn it off for rolls beyond the first each turn, or when no bonded creature is near.</p></section>",
      "chat": ""
    },
